          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hafuurri Qulqulluun bifa gugeetiin mulʼatee isa irratti gad buʼe. Sagaleen, \"Ati Ilma koo isa ani jaalladhuu dha; ani sitti nan gammada\" jedhu tokkos samii irraa ni dhufe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
